{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:05:37+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Runika: A World of Little Legends", "steam_appid": 1476680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a farm… to save the world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Runika</i> is a cozy 2D sandbox RPG about farming, exploration and challenging boss battles. Inspired by classic SNES adventures, the spirit of the 90s can be felt in every corner of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross the mysterious Rift between worlds, build your own farm and shape the land however you like, free from the pressure of strict day-cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what has awakened deep within the Realm-Between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/5a705f3435d7b283472fbba0a01c3d51.poster.avif?t=1793903429\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/5a705f3435d7b283472fbba0a01c3d51.webm?t=1793903429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/5a705f3435d7b283472fbba0a01c3d51.mp4?t=1793903429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own cozy farm without the pressure of daily cycles or seasonal deadlines. Grow crops and keep animals in your own enclosures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape a fully terraformable world to your liking. Dig irrigation channels for your fields, lay down paths and connect everything with minecart tracks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a cozy adventure with challenging but fair boss fights that reward preparation and experimentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the paths of the Realm-Between and explore ancient ruins to uncover more about the threat emerging from the Rift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, unlock recipes and craft hundreds of tools, decorations, meals and other useful items across many different crafting stations and ovens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your home with furniture, carpets and decorations to slowly turn Runika into a place of your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern pixel art adventure inspired by the 16-bit era, filled with small references to classic SNES games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/5559b569e39b377fa1dbc1a6eabbf36b.apng?t=1793903429\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/5559b569e39b377fa1dbc1a6eabbf36b.poster.avif?t=1793903429\" class=\"bb_img\" width=336 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developed live on Twitch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve been developing Runika live on Twitch since 2020. Become part of the community and join me on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/c9d01e2c733ef252dfc56d28f35cbe89.avif?t=1793903429\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We speak English too! Mostly German though, hence just drop in and we’ll switch. &lt;3 </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a farm… to save the world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Runika</i> is a cozy 2D sandbox RPG about farming, exploration and challenging boss battles. Inspired by classic SNES adventures, the spirit of the 90s can be felt in every corner of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross the mysterious Rift between worlds, build your own farm and shape the land however you like, free from the pressure of strict day-cycles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what has awakened deep within the Realm-Between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/5a705f3435d7b283472fbba0a01c3d51.poster.avif?t=1793903429\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/5a705f3435d7b283472fbba0a01c3d51.webm?t=1793903429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/5a705f3435d7b283472fbba0a01c3d51.mp4?t=1793903429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own cozy farm without the pressure of daily cycles or seasonal deadlines. Grow crops and keep animals in your own enclosures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape a fully terraformable world to your liking. Dig irrigation channels for your fields, lay down paths and connect everything with minecart tracks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a cozy adventure with challenging but fair boss fights that reward preparation and experimentation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the paths of the Realm-Between and explore ancient ruins to uncover more about the threat emerging from the Rift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, unlock recipes and craft hundreds of tools, decorations, meals and other useful items across many different crafting stations and ovens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your home with furniture, carpets and decorations to slowly turn Runika into a place of your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern pixel art adventure inspired by the 16-bit era, filled with small references to classic SNES games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/5559b569e39b377fa1dbc1a6eabbf36b.apng?t=1793903429\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/5559b569e39b377fa1dbc1a6eabbf36b.poster.avif?t=1793903429\" class=\"bb_img\" width=336 height=64 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developed live on Twitch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve been developing Runika live on Twitch since 2020. Become part of the community and join me on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1476680/extras/c9d01e2c733ef252dfc56d28f35cbe89.avif?t=1793903429\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We speak English too! Mostly German though, hence just drop in and we’ll switch. &lt;3 </p>", "short_description": "Build a farm… to save the world. Runika combines a cozy 2D sandbox with a story about a world being drawn into the mysterious Rift. Grow crops at your own pace, build your farm, gather resources, craft your own equipment, and uncover what awakens within the Rift.", "supported_languages": "English, German, French, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese -